<h1 class="article-title">Chambers Commits</h1>

<p class="article-meta">
📅 8 March 2026 | Club Announcement
</p>

<img src="../images/garymillsmkdons.jpg"
alt="Whistle FC Coaching Team"
class="article-image">

<div class="article-body">

<p>
We are delighted to announce that 18-year-old Rowan Chambers has signed a new contract which will keep him at the club until the summmer of 2028!
</p>

<p>
The England U18 international has made 10 senior appearances so far this season, including scoring his first senior goal in the Wetshil and Dattylandshire Cup.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Here's to a big two years Ro!<strong>
</p>


